OL,3,AHyrox apologises for allowing race to
OL,4,Acontinue after athlete soils herself
OL,5,
OL,6,FInternational athletics brand Hyrox has
OL,7,Fissued an apology after it came under
OL,8,Ffire for allowing an athlete to
OL,9,Fcomplete a race in Beijing despite
OL,10,Fsoiling herself midway through the
OL,11,Fevent.
OL,13,FFootage of the woman competing in the
OL,14,Findoor fitness competition raised
OL,15,Fconcerns around hygiene and questions
OL,16,Fover why race organisers allowed her to
OL,17,Fcontinue.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
