OL,3,AHyrox apologises for allowing race to
OL,4,Acontinue after athlete soils herself
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter a wave of criticism, Hyrox
OL,7,Fco-founder Moritz Furste apologised to
OL,8,Fall those affected "directly or
OL,9,Findirectly" by the incident and said
OL,10,Fthe brand is working to make immediate
OL,11,Frule changes.
OL,13,FHowever, one expert told the BBC that
OL,14,Fallowing the athlete to continue could
OL,15,Frepresent an attitude within the
OL,16,Fcompany that places sporting results
OL,17,Fover important factors.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
